WEBVTT

01:35.920 --> 01:40.810
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.660 --> 01:43.920
[Episode 24]

01:58.200 --> 01:59.759
Your Highness, please halt.

01:59.759 --> 02:03.090
No one may trespass in the Inner Palace without permission.

02:04.400 --> 02:05.600
Come here, come here.

02:38.050 --> 02:39.620
[Ning'an Hall]

02:43.270 --> 02:46.000
What an impressive show of force,
Your Highness!

02:47.520 --> 02:50.380
You actually stormed into the palace
with your men.

02:50.590 --> 02:52.190
Are you staging a rebellion?

02:53.710 --> 02:54.870
What rebellion?

02:55.400 --> 02:57.150
These are merely guards from my household.

02:57.150 --> 02:59.810
How could such a small number
stage a rebellion?

02:59.870 --> 03:00.940
What a joke.

03:01.360 --> 03:05.090
Since when are household guards allowed
into the imperial palace?

03:09.430 --> 03:11.630
I know perfectly well what you're up to.

03:12.360 --> 03:13.080
Don't think

03:13.080 --> 03:15.610
you can control
His Majesty's life and death.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.530
I'm still here.

03:17.960 --> 03:19.310
You're slandering me.

03:19.710 --> 03:20.520
There's no need

03:20.520 --> 03:21.630
for this back-and-forth bickering.

03:21.630 --> 03:23.030
It's just a waste of time.

03:23.400 --> 03:25.750
Heaven will judge
whether you're loyal or treacherous.

03:25.750 --> 03:27.010
As long as I'm here,

03:27.560 --> 03:30.020
you can't harm His Majesty
in the slightest.

03:30.430 --> 03:32.630
You can't stop what I intend to do.

03:41.460 --> 03:42.520
Stop him!

03:42.790 --> 03:44.640
Today, by the order of my ancestors,

03:44.640 --> 03:46.440
I am here to protect His Majesty.

03:47.010 --> 03:48.829
Anyone who dares to stop me

03:49.800 --> 03:51.190
will be killed without mercy!

03:51.190 --> 03:52.390
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

04:19.829 --> 04:21.380
T-Terrible news! Terrible news!

04:21.380 --> 04:22.060
Terrible news!

04:22.060 --> 04:22.600
His Majesty...

04:22.600 --> 04:24.260
His Majesty has disappeared!

04:36.950 --> 04:38.150
Where is His Majesty?

04:40.830 --> 04:42.720
That's what I should be asking you.

04:42.720 --> 04:44.180
I just entered the palace.

04:44.630 --> 04:46.000
You've guarded His Majesty

04:46.000 --> 04:47.190
in the palace the entire time.

04:47.190 --> 04:48.920
Where did you send His Majesty?

04:49.510 --> 04:51.190
With the Jinwu Guards present,

04:51.190 --> 04:52.940
no one can take His Majesty away.

04:52.940 --> 04:55.000
Since the Jinwu Guards are also gone,

04:55.390 --> 04:56.250
it can only mean

04:56.280 --> 04:58.409
His Majesty woke up and left on his own.

05:09.010 --> 05:09.830
If someone

05:09.830 --> 05:11.270
had forcibly abducted His Majesty,

05:11.270 --> 05:13.270
there would be signs of a fight here.

05:13.360 --> 05:14.390
Even Eunuch Ma

05:14.390 --> 05:15.830
and Lord Ling are gone.

05:16.600 --> 05:17.750
This can only mean His Majesty himself

05:17.750 --> 05:19.040
wanted to leave.

05:20.360 --> 05:21.680
But why would His Majesty

05:21.680 --> 05:22.670
leave?

05:28.620 --> 05:31.310
[Zichen Hall]

05:51.040 --> 05:52.720
Don't you dare step forward!

05:53.070 --> 05:57.670
[Zichen Hall]

06:06.430 --> 06:07.560
If you are truly

06:07.560 --> 06:08.920
as loyal as you claim

06:09.390 --> 06:10.850
and have been guarding
His Majesty all along in the palace,

06:10.850 --> 06:12.980
why didn't he inform you when he awoke?

06:16.230 --> 06:18.360
From my understanding of His Majesty,

06:18.430 --> 06:19.750
he would never leave the palace

06:19.750 --> 06:21.880
unless he sensed grave danger within.

06:21.950 --> 06:24.250
How could there be any danger
in the palace?

06:24.250 --> 06:26.050
You're just spouting nonsense.

06:26.600 --> 06:27.850
You just said

06:28.560 --> 06:30.820
I can't stop you from doing what you want.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.430
You've been colluding with Murong Yao,

06:32.430 --> 06:33.770
having him
secretly conspire with Xia Jingshi—

06:33.770 --> 06:35.420
what is your real scheme?

06:35.620 --> 06:37.200
Murong Yao is your friend.

06:37.750 --> 06:39.600
He's been colluding with Xia Jingshi,

06:39.600 --> 06:40.930
and you want to kill him.

06:41.480 --> 06:43.480
But what does that have to do with me?

06:45.770 --> 06:47.500
I don't care what plot you have,

06:47.750 --> 06:49.310
but if you dare

06:49.330 --> 06:51.130
threaten His Majesty's safety,

06:52.240 --> 06:53.700
I won't let you off.

06:54.040 --> 06:55.840
Since His Majesty has awakened,

06:56.560 --> 06:57.920
when he returns,

06:58.800 --> 06:59.430
you will pay

06:59.430 --> 07:01.270
for what you did today.

07:16.940 --> 07:21.550
[Zichen Hall]

07:27.190 --> 07:27.720
Let's go.

07:30.270 --> 07:30.800
Get them!

07:32.630 --> 07:37.909
[Zichen Hall]

07:42.880 --> 07:43.740
Your Highness.

07:49.950 --> 07:51.120
The Imperial Guards' duty is

07:51.120 --> 07:52.720
to protect the royal family.

07:52.920 --> 07:53.750
Today, you're going to

07:53.750 --> 07:56.350
stop me for the sake of
a treacherous official?

07:56.920 --> 07:57.870
Your Highness,

07:58.920 --> 08:01.320
please don't make things difficult for us.

08:01.830 --> 08:02.440
Come here.

08:03.630 --> 08:04.790
Come closer.

08:41.510 --> 08:42.440
Prime Minister,

08:43.080 --> 08:43.909
the First Prince has not committed

08:43.909 --> 08:45.110
any act of rebellion.

08:45.270 --> 08:46.550
As for his crime
of trespassing in the palace,

08:46.550 --> 08:48.510
only His Majesty himself can
pass judgment.

08:48.510 --> 08:50.490
We dare not stop him.

08:50.770 --> 08:52.030
His Majesty left the palace,

08:52.030 --> 08:53.870
and you were completely unaware.

08:53.870 --> 08:54.750
How fitting

08:54.750 --> 08:56.410
for Susha's Imperial Guards!

08:57.150 --> 08:58.720
If you can't find His Majesty,

08:58.720 --> 09:01.050
end your lives and atone for your failure!

09:01.750 --> 09:02.320
Yes.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.220
Your Highness,

09:05.360 --> 09:06.170
behind Rongyang Palace is

09:06.170 --> 09:07.670
the rear gate of the imperial palace.

09:07.670 --> 09:08.630
I left from there,

09:08.630 --> 09:09.830
and no one stopped me.

09:09.870 --> 09:12.150
Today, I wandered the streets for a while,

09:12.150 --> 09:13.630
shook off those tailing me,

09:13.630 --> 09:15.490
and found out who they really are.

09:15.910 --> 09:16.480
Good.

09:17.550 --> 09:18.680
Have we made contact

09:18.840 --> 09:19.720
with Wang Encheng?

09:19.720 --> 09:21.720
His grandfather followed the late emperor
on campaign

09:21.720 --> 09:22.790
and earned battle honors.

09:22.790 --> 09:24.120
He was granted a hereditary post and,

09:24.120 --> 09:25.600
with his grandfather arranging it,

09:25.600 --> 09:27.430
married the niece
of the Marquis of Bao'an.

09:27.430 --> 09:29.840
From then on, his official career was
smooth sailing.

09:29.840 --> 09:30.650
But now...

09:31.200 --> 09:31.910
his wife

09:32.630 --> 09:34.430
has been favored by Xia Jingyan.

09:34.600 --> 09:35.810
The affair has caused quite a stir.

09:35.810 --> 09:36.960
The whole city knows about it.

09:36.960 --> 09:38.620
He can only swallow his anger.

09:38.790 --> 09:40.390
Now he's full of grievances,

09:40.670 --> 09:42.070
and everyone avoids him.

09:42.600 --> 09:43.570
There's also

09:43.720 --> 09:45.920
the Vice Minister of Works... Dai Quan?

09:46.030 --> 09:46.370
Yes.

09:47.120 --> 09:49.120
Xia Jingyan's been supervising work
on the Empress Dowager's mausoleum,

09:49.120 --> 09:51.530
and Dai Quan has been
at the construction site on Mount Gu.

09:51.530 --> 09:52.990
I haven't reached him yet.

09:53.240 --> 09:54.630
But I have made contact

09:54.720 --> 09:55.650
with the others.

09:56.200 --> 09:58.130
When you went to find those people,

09:58.270 --> 09:59.330
did anyone see you?

09:59.720 --> 10:00.530
I found Wang Encheng

10:00.530 --> 10:01.460
at a restaurant.

10:01.750 --> 10:03.880
There must have been people who saw us.

10:06.030 --> 10:07.560
Any word from Bai Shouzhuo?

10:07.720 --> 10:08.910
He said he's found a couple of

10:08.910 --> 10:10.240
the men you're looking for.

10:10.240 --> 10:12.240
They are all placed in key positions.

10:12.240 --> 10:14.360
He also said that
if Your Highness has further instructions,

10:14.360 --> 10:16.490
you can leave messages in the Library.

10:16.750 --> 10:17.280
How about

10:17.720 --> 10:19.120
I go to the Library again?

10:19.240 --> 10:19.700
No need.

10:21.120 --> 10:23.250
You should just focus on those officials

10:23.250 --> 10:24.980
and stay out of palace affairs.

10:33.910 --> 10:34.550
I had the maids

10:34.550 --> 10:35.790
brew some flower tea.

10:36.150 --> 10:37.390
My Prince, if you like it,

10:37.390 --> 10:38.520
please try it first.

10:40.510 --> 10:42.150
When Your Highness the Princess left
Rongyang Palace today,

10:42.150 --> 10:43.410
did anyone follow you?

10:46.040 --> 10:47.170
A guard followed me,

10:47.670 --> 10:48.360
but seeing

10:48.360 --> 10:50.020
I was just out to pick flowers,

10:50.200 --> 10:51.840
he kept watch from outside the hall
at a distance.

10:51.840 --> 10:52.640
What's wrong?

10:52.960 --> 10:53.510
Your Highness,

10:53.510 --> 10:54.370
how about we...

10:57.850 --> 10:59.330
Is there anything I can do?

11:02.820 --> 11:03.750
I know you don't want to

11:03.750 --> 11:05.280
be under house arrest here.

11:05.630 --> 11:07.200
If there's anything I can do,

11:07.200 --> 11:07.960
just say it.

11:13.060 --> 11:15.190
What are you worried about, My Prince?

11:15.550 --> 11:16.150
Right now,

11:16.150 --> 11:17.410
we're in the same boat.

11:18.030 --> 11:18.840
Besides, I don't want to

11:18.840 --> 11:20.170
be trapped here either.

11:30.370 --> 11:37.030
[Murong Residence]

11:32.510 --> 11:33.360
Go to the palace.

11:33.360 --> 11:33.720
Yes.

11:41.460 --> 11:44.600
[Murong Residence]

11:52.390 --> 11:54.240
I put the Imperial Guards
under your command.

11:54.240 --> 11:55.200
How could you have no clue

11:55.200 --> 11:57.060
when His Majesty left the palace?

11:59.240 --> 12:00.840
If His Majesty didn't want anyone to know,

12:00.840 --> 12:02.040
he had plenty of ways.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.510
What I'm worried about now is

12:03.510 --> 12:04.610
why he left.

12:05.000 --> 12:05.550
Has he

12:06.390 --> 12:07.390
already noticed

12:07.390 --> 12:08.360
what I'm planning to do?

12:08.360 --> 12:09.630
You mean he's been awake this whole time,

12:09.630 --> 12:11.160
just pretending to fool us?

12:12.240 --> 12:14.200
Feng Pingcheng cannot be underestimated.

12:14.200 --> 12:15.460
Without such methods,

12:15.480 --> 12:16.140
how could it

12:16.510 --> 12:18.200
have been his turn
to become emperor back then?

12:18.200 --> 12:19.120
Then, with one imperial edict,

12:19.120 --> 12:20.920
he could have us both destroyed.

12:20.940 --> 12:22.470
Why leave the palace at all?

12:23.620 --> 12:24.670
If it's really as you say—

12:24.670 --> 12:26.270
that Feng Pingcheng knows everything—

12:26.270 --> 12:27.000
once he returns to the palace,

12:27.000 --> 12:28.130
it will be our death.

12:28.550 --> 12:29.410
We must find him quickly

12:29.410 --> 12:30.240
and kill him.

12:31.120 --> 12:32.960
I don't want to implicate my father.

12:32.960 --> 12:35.270
I don't want my father to die
because of me.

12:35.270 --> 12:36.230
Even now,

12:36.440 --> 12:39.000
you're still thinking
only about your father?

12:39.000 --> 12:39.670
Everything I'm doing

12:39.670 --> 12:40.360
is for my father

12:40.360 --> 12:41.360
and for our Murong family!

12:41.360 --> 12:42.970
Then help me kill Feng Suige.

12:43.030 --> 12:44.030
As long as he dies,

12:44.200 --> 12:45.510
Chengyang will be the sole heir

12:45.510 --> 12:46.420
of Susha.

12:47.080 --> 12:49.680
Feng Pingcheng waking up
won't change a thing.

12:52.550 --> 12:53.960
After Chengyang ascends the throne,

12:53.960 --> 12:54.970
you'll become

12:55.190 --> 12:57.850
the only prince
of a different lineage in Susha.

12:57.870 --> 12:58.960
Once you're enfeoffed as king

12:58.960 --> 13:00.090
with your own fiefs,

13:00.200 --> 13:00.910
only then can you take back

13:00.910 --> 13:02.440
what your family deserves.

13:04.840 --> 13:05.870
Only in this way

13:06.150 --> 13:07.080
can you bring peace

13:07.080 --> 13:09.010
to your father's spirit in heaven.

13:20.480 --> 13:21.870
What nonsense are you talking about?

13:21.870 --> 13:23.270
What "spirit in heaven"?

13:23.390 --> 13:24.030
You're insane.

13:24.030 --> 13:25.840
What makes you think
you can stand against Feng Suige?

13:25.840 --> 13:26.910
If the Feng Battalion marches rapidly,

13:26.910 --> 13:29.240
they'll reach the city gates within a day!

13:33.870 --> 13:35.870
How do you know I have no backup plan?

13:41.750 --> 13:42.910
This is the stronghold

13:42.910 --> 13:44.570
my son established years ago.

13:44.600 --> 13:46.080
Following Jingheng's plan,

13:46.080 --> 13:48.200
I've been secretly training
my own soldiers.

13:48.200 --> 13:50.660
We still have a chance
to turn things around.

14:04.600 --> 14:05.130
General,

14:05.390 --> 14:06.420
the household has sent word:

14:06.420 --> 14:09.150
they've found
the Elder Marquis's whereabouts.

14:16.030 --> 14:17.510
Once I make sure my father is safe,

14:17.510 --> 14:18.310
I'll help you.

14:28.090 --> 14:28.520
[Library]

14:35.910 --> 14:37.030
Your Highness just needs to

14:37.030 --> 14:37.840
place the item

14:37.840 --> 14:38.790
on the bottom shelf of the last bookshelf

14:38.790 --> 14:39.650
in the library.

14:41.240 --> 14:41.960
Someone

14:42.160 --> 14:43.490
will come for it in time.

14:44.180 --> 14:44.780
Remember:

14:45.480 --> 14:47.540
don't let anyone find out about this.

15:05.330 --> 15:05.770
[Taiping Holy Prescriptions
for Universal Relief]

15:05.840 --> 15:07.010
[Library]

15:06.000 --> 15:07.460
Greetings, Your Majesty.

15:16.550 --> 15:18.010
Greetings, Your Majesty.

15:19.310 --> 15:21.080
Why are you here, Your Majesty?

15:21.400 --> 15:23.340
Shouldn't I be asking you that?

15:24.510 --> 15:25.700
I have nothing to do,

15:26.000 --> 15:28.200
so I thought I'd find some books to read.

15:34.360 --> 15:35.480
I'm curious

15:36.320 --> 15:38.520
what kinds of books you are looking for.

15:45.120 --> 15:45.670
This one?

15:55.910 --> 15:56.440
This one?

16:01.760 --> 16:02.130
[Rhapsody on the Ethical Order]

16:05.040 --> 16:06.350
Or the ones below?

16:07.860 --> 16:08.290
[Grand View of Materia Medica]

16:08.380 --> 16:08.880
[Xunzi]

16:10.910 --> 16:11.640
These books?

16:17.630 --> 16:18.540
[Xunzi]

16:20.890 --> 16:21.720
[Xunzi]

16:22.030 --> 16:23.360
Your Majesty needn't look any further!

16:23.360 --> 16:24.330
[Xunzi]

16:26.670 --> 16:27.720
I'll tell you.

16:28.170 --> 16:29.320
[Xunzi]

16:31.300 --> 16:32.910
Ever since I arrived in Shengjing,

16:32.910 --> 16:34.970
My Prince has been distant toward me.

16:36.030 --> 16:36.960
I had no choice

16:37.960 --> 16:39.760
but to come here to find books...

16:42.480 --> 16:44.670
on the art of marital harmony.

16:46.960 --> 16:48.120
Marital harmony?

16:52.100 --> 16:54.320
That sounds very profound and mysterious.

16:54.320 --> 16:55.790
Why don't you explain it to me

16:55.790 --> 16:56.570
and teach me?

16:59.830 --> 17:01.560
What are you really doing here?

17:03.590 --> 17:05.710
Your Majesty, please don't humiliate me.

17:05.710 --> 17:08.510
Your Majesty,
please conduct yourself properly.

17:09.510 --> 17:10.770
You're overthinking.

17:10.819 --> 17:12.380
How am I humiliating you?

17:12.720 --> 17:13.780
Princess, don't be angry.

17:13.780 --> 17:14.780
I was just joking.

17:17.440 --> 17:18.109
If you truly

17:18.109 --> 17:19.700
want to please Xia Jingshi,

17:20.000 --> 17:21.000
find him some books

17:21.000 --> 17:22.550
on the art of war.

17:23.510 --> 17:24.480
He has always liked

17:24.480 --> 17:26.880
such impractical things since childhood.

17:46.310 --> 17:47.510
Did Your Highness's trip to the Library

17:47.510 --> 17:48.240
go smoothly?

17:49.480 --> 17:51.010
Everything went smoothly.

17:51.310 --> 17:51.790
I heard

17:51.790 --> 17:53.850
the Emperor also went to the Library.

17:53.920 --> 17:55.980
He didn't give you a hard time, did he?

17:59.830 --> 18:01.030
We must have missed each other.

18:01.030 --> 18:01.980
I didn't see him.

18:05.680 --> 18:07.070
My Prince must be hungry by now.

18:07.070 --> 18:09.200
I'll go speed things up in the kitchen.

18:13.000 --> 18:14.930
Just as we were talking, here it is.

18:27.350 --> 18:28.410
Dried fish flakes,

18:28.790 --> 18:31.790
Crystal Dragon Phoenix Cake,
preserved cherries...

18:32.000 --> 18:34.000
These are all Susha's specialties.

18:34.310 --> 18:35.030
My Prince, you had them

18:35.030 --> 18:36.680
specially prepare these dishes for me?

18:36.680 --> 18:37.410
It wasn't me.

18:40.960 --> 18:42.090
It wasn't me either.

18:46.550 --> 18:47.160
My Prince.

18:48.350 --> 18:50.480
Try this Crystal Dragon Phoenix Cake.

18:51.030 --> 18:51.890
It's not sweet.

18:52.400 --> 18:53.680
Back in Susha,

18:54.110 --> 18:55.240
I often made it for my father

18:55.240 --> 18:56.160
and brother.

18:57.350 --> 18:57.950
Everyone.

19:01.350 --> 19:02.200
This servant was sent here

19:02.200 --> 19:03.460
by His Majesty's order

19:03.920 --> 19:06.780
to deliver a message
to Your Highness the Princess.

19:07.640 --> 19:09.170
Go ahead, Chief Eunuch Bai.

19:12.720 --> 19:14.440
"I deeply understand that you,
Princess of Zhennan,

19:14.440 --> 19:15.440
must feel homesick

19:15.440 --> 19:16.720
residing in Shengjing.

19:16.720 --> 19:18.200
Today, I've specially ordered
the Imperial Kitchen

19:18.200 --> 19:19.640
to prepare some Susha delicacies

19:19.640 --> 19:21.480
to help ease your homesickness.

19:21.720 --> 19:23.450
Please enjoy them, Princess."

19:28.790 --> 19:30.550
I thank His Majesty
for his great kindness.

19:30.550 --> 19:33.150
His Majesty said
there's no need for courtesy.

19:33.510 --> 19:34.350
He also said

19:34.680 --> 19:36.540
today's encounter at the Library

19:36.550 --> 19:38.150
brought him great pleasure.

19:49.070 --> 19:50.200
Hound has led the Qiongqi Unit

19:50.200 --> 19:51.480
to seal off the imperial palace.

19:51.480 --> 19:53.160
The moment Zhuang Shen leaves the palace,

19:53.160 --> 19:54.270
we'll be notified.

19:54.290 --> 19:55.350
Yun Fang. Yun Qing.

19:55.400 --> 19:56.030
-Yes.
-Yes.

19:56.030 --> 19:57.270
Return to the Feng Battalion immediately

19:57.270 --> 19:58.220
and gather all the elites.

19:58.220 --> 19:59.490
By tomorrow noon,

19:59.550 --> 20:01.110
assemble 10 li outside Yujing City.

20:01.110 --> 20:01.770
-Yes.
-Yes.

20:04.000 --> 20:05.860
Then I'll go find His Majesty now.

20:06.350 --> 20:07.750
That won't be necessary!

20:12.240 --> 20:13.880
Your father is also looking for you.

20:13.880 --> 20:14.640
Come with me.

20:14.880 --> 20:16.080
He's waiting for you.

20:20.220 --> 20:21.920
Your old man woke up three days ago

20:21.920 --> 20:23.570
but was too weak to move.

20:23.720 --> 20:25.030
He told me to keep it a secret

20:25.030 --> 20:27.070
while he pretended to be unconscious.

20:27.070 --> 20:28.420
Today, he suddenly said
he wanted to leave the palace

20:28.420 --> 20:29.260
to come here.

20:29.750 --> 20:31.260
He regained consciousness
without telling anyone,

20:31.260 --> 20:32.000
and now

20:32.000 --> 20:33.640
he's left the palace in secret—

20:33.640 --> 20:34.970
what exactly happened?

20:35.200 --> 20:36.880
I'm not entirely clear either.

20:36.880 --> 20:37.510
You'd better

20:37.510 --> 20:39.040
ask your old man yourself in a moment.

20:39.040 --> 20:39.550
Oh, and

20:40.240 --> 20:41.030
he's witnessed

20:41.030 --> 20:42.510
too much treachery these past few days.

20:42.510 --> 20:43.460
He's in a bad mood.

20:43.460 --> 20:44.650
Don't provoke him.

20:47.350 --> 20:48.440
Your Highness,

20:49.480 --> 20:51.210
His Majesty is waiting for you.

20:52.190 --> 20:53.790
Since my mother passed away,

20:54.070 --> 20:55.800
he's never set foot here again.

20:56.160 --> 20:57.350
I thought he'd forgotten

20:57.350 --> 20:59.350
my mother even had a residence here.

21:00.790 --> 21:01.670
Go ahead.

21:02.160 --> 21:03.620
I'll wait for you outside.

21:37.070 --> 21:38.740
Greetings, Your Majesty.

21:40.110 --> 21:41.770
How is Your Majesty's health?

21:42.550 --> 21:43.750
I heard

21:43.750 --> 21:46.010
you barged into the palace with your men.

21:46.440 --> 21:47.680
For what purpose?

21:48.790 --> 21:50.190
To protect Your Majesty.

21:55.560 --> 21:58.690
Why wasn't it to stage a palace coup
and seize the throne?

22:01.690 --> 22:03.440
That throne of mine

22:03.470 --> 22:05.520
doesn't tempt you at all?

22:07.000 --> 22:09.000
You were unconscious for many days,

22:09.030 --> 22:09.920
so you probably don't know

22:09.920 --> 22:11.390
what's happened in the palace.

22:11.390 --> 22:13.540
What could possibly be new?

22:14.010 --> 22:15.440
Treacherous ministers
controlling the court,

22:15.440 --> 22:16.990
officials taking sides,

22:17.020 --> 22:18.890
rebels revealing their ambitions,

22:18.890 --> 22:20.200
and sycophants clinging to

22:20.200 --> 22:21.270
whoever has power—

22:21.380 --> 22:23.110
the same old story.

22:23.400 --> 22:25.200
I raised an army at 28,

22:25.220 --> 22:27.550
founded the nation,
and became emperor at 33.

22:27.550 --> 22:29.900
To this day, I've reigned for 25 years.

22:30.590 --> 22:32.400
There's no court intrigue

22:32.750 --> 22:33.920
or palace turmoil

22:33.920 --> 22:35.880
I haven't already seen.

22:36.680 --> 22:39.000
You're suffering from a terminal illness
and didn't tell me.

22:39.000 --> 22:40.510
You woke up three days ago

22:40.510 --> 22:41.720
and still didn't tell me.

22:41.720 --> 22:42.390
What?

22:42.550 --> 22:44.440
Do I have to report everything to you?

22:44.440 --> 22:45.200
Are you blaming me

22:45.200 --> 22:46.880
for forcing my way into the palace today?

22:46.880 --> 22:48.030
Zhuang Shen is plotting treason,

22:48.030 --> 22:49.510
and the palace is full of danger.

22:49.510 --> 22:50.480
I brought men to the palace

22:50.480 --> 22:51.590
because I didn't want you to die...

22:51.590 --> 22:52.790
If I died,

22:52.790 --> 22:53.680
wouldn't that be

22:53.680 --> 22:55.480
your heaven-sent opportunity?

22:56.500 --> 22:58.570
I've waited all these days,

22:58.750 --> 22:59.790
yet you've shown

22:59.790 --> 23:02.240
no intention whatsoever
of rebelling to seize the throne.

23:02.240 --> 23:04.270
I've painstakingly groomed you for years,

23:04.270 --> 23:05.480
yet you don't even have

23:05.480 --> 23:07.610
a spark of ambition to become emperor!

23:07.960 --> 23:10.160
You've disappointed me greatly.

23:11.240 --> 23:12.810
By your logic,

23:13.400 --> 23:14.510
I was wrong not to

23:14.510 --> 23:15.350
rebel and usurp the throne

23:15.350 --> 23:16.310
while you lay dying?

23:16.310 --> 23:17.070
Yes.

23:17.480 --> 23:18.880
Of course you were wrong!

23:19.160 --> 23:20.420
You are utterly wrong!

23:21.020 --> 23:23.280
You are my son.

23:23.400 --> 23:25.640
You should've coveted the throne.

23:25.640 --> 23:27.350
You should've wished me dead!

23:27.400 --> 23:28.770
You should've schemed day and night

23:28.770 --> 23:30.560
to take this empire for yourself!

23:30.560 --> 23:33.360
That is what you,
as the First Prince of Susha,

23:34.200 --> 23:35.790
ought to do.

23:37.790 --> 23:39.070
Do you think the throne

23:39.160 --> 23:41.360
will automatically be yours once I die?

23:42.070 --> 23:43.070
If you don't fight for the throne,

23:43.070 --> 23:43.790
it'll

23:43.790 --> 23:46.090
fall into someone else's hands!

23:46.200 --> 23:48.070
I have no interest in your throne.

23:51.160 --> 23:52.500
That is exactly

23:52.640 --> 23:54.960
what I despise most about you.

23:59.480 --> 23:59.830
Sit.

24:11.830 --> 24:13.510
How is your arm now?

24:13.640 --> 24:14.240
Let me see.

24:14.920 --> 24:16.880
Everyone says you're a miracle worker.

24:16.880 --> 24:17.960
Well, I've nearly fully recovered.

24:17.960 --> 24:18.960
Now, when I draw the bow,

24:18.960 --> 24:19.830
it doesn't feel

24:19.830 --> 24:21.290
as strenuous as it used to.

24:22.920 --> 24:24.050
Here, grip my wrist.

24:28.700 --> 24:29.440
Good, good.

24:30.510 --> 24:31.840
You've recovered well.

24:32.000 --> 24:33.720
You've recovered really well.

24:33.720 --> 24:34.110
I'm telling you,

24:34.110 --> 24:35.750
you'd better take good care of that arm.

24:35.750 --> 24:36.400
I'll be

24:36.400 --> 24:37.590
boasting about treating your arm—

24:37.590 --> 24:38.920
don't make me look bad.

24:40.070 --> 24:40.800
Don't worry.

24:44.400 --> 24:46.720
Something big is going to happen
in Yujing City.

24:46.720 --> 24:48.070
If you have no pressing matters,

24:48.070 --> 24:50.470
come stay at my Zhengnian Villa
for a while.

24:51.000 --> 24:52.600
I appreciate your kindness,

24:53.480 --> 24:53.960
but...

24:54.750 --> 24:55.750
I can't leave yet.

24:56.960 --> 24:57.760
You're right.

24:58.200 --> 24:59.240
This family has

24:59.790 --> 25:01.520
far too many tangled problems.

25:02.200 --> 25:04.550
You think I'll simply wait to be killed?

25:05.310 --> 25:07.610
The realm I conquered with my blood—

25:07.640 --> 25:09.670
you think I'd just hand it to others?

25:10.680 --> 25:12.480
I must personally choose an heir

25:13.030 --> 25:15.270
while I'm still alive.

25:18.550 --> 25:20.000
Are you telling me this

25:20.000 --> 25:21.590
just to say

25:22.310 --> 25:23.510
you've chosen me?

25:24.110 --> 25:24.960
What else?

25:27.270 --> 25:28.130
Other than you,

25:29.070 --> 25:30.920
I have no choice.

25:30.920 --> 25:31.850
Of course you do.

25:32.400 --> 25:33.240
Xiyang, Chengyang,

25:33.240 --> 25:34.240
they're your children too.

25:34.240 --> 25:35.590
Nonsense.

25:36.350 --> 25:37.990
Xiyang is a woman.

25:38.440 --> 25:39.400
So what?

25:39.930 --> 25:41.030
If she becomes empress,

25:41.030 --> 25:42.090
I'll personally go

25:42.160 --> 25:43.240
chop off the heads of

25:43.240 --> 25:44.440
those who oppose her.

25:45.510 --> 25:46.110
Child,

25:46.640 --> 25:47.880
you think you can

25:47.880 --> 25:49.880
stand against the whole world?

25:50.240 --> 25:50.890
Fine.

25:51.440 --> 25:53.500
If you dare not choose a woman to rule,

25:53.680 --> 25:54.720
you still have Chengyang.

25:54.720 --> 25:55.890
I will never let

25:55.960 --> 25:57.470
someone with the Zhuang bloodline

25:57.470 --> 25:59.070
inherit my throne!

25:59.070 --> 25:59.960
This one won't do,

25:59.960 --> 26:00.550
and that one you refuse—

26:00.550 --> 26:01.750
why so many concerns?

26:01.750 --> 26:02.720
You clearly still

26:02.720 --> 26:06.750
-cling to your imperial ambition.
-That's because you're not cruel enough—

26:06.750 --> 26:09.320
not enough to shatter my obsession.

26:09.440 --> 26:10.680
When I fell gravely ill,

26:10.680 --> 26:12.590
you didn't seize the opportunity
to expand your power

26:12.590 --> 26:14.710
or take my throne.

26:14.790 --> 26:18.420
You actually stayed at my bedside
playing the dutiful son...

26:19.440 --> 26:21.850
What I do is my business.

26:23.640 --> 26:24.680
No, no, no.

26:25.160 --> 26:26.070
I, Feng Pingcheng,

26:26.070 --> 26:28.100
don't need a filial son!

26:28.310 --> 26:29.490
What I want is

26:29.880 --> 26:31.350
an heir with ambition and spine,

26:31.350 --> 26:32.820
with courage and cunning—

26:32.880 --> 26:34.480
one who would betray the world

26:34.480 --> 26:36.310
if necessary

26:36.310 --> 26:37.070
to become a mighty ruler!

26:37.070 --> 26:38.350
Then listen up!

26:39.550 --> 26:40.850
Being your son

26:41.350 --> 26:42.740
is my misfortune.

26:43.070 --> 26:44.480
I never agreed

26:44.480 --> 26:45.400
to be your heir.

26:45.880 --> 26:47.480
What you've pursued your entire life

26:47.480 --> 26:48.960
means nothing to me!

26:50.270 --> 26:51.270
I don't care

26:52.640 --> 26:53.960
for your empire at all.

26:58.880 --> 26:59.640
Stop!

27:09.510 --> 27:10.720
After Feng Pingcheng awoke,

27:10.720 --> 27:12.520
he could no longer feel his legs.

27:12.720 --> 27:15.120
He probably won't be able to
stand up again.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.960
I'm not sure

27:18.030 --> 27:19.510
how much longer he can live.

27:19.510 --> 27:20.400
Let him be.

27:27.510 --> 27:29.040
What happened to your legs?

27:29.160 --> 27:29.920
Go.

27:31.310 --> 27:32.430
Why look back?

27:37.920 --> 27:39.590
The way you look now

27:40.200 --> 27:41.200
is exactly

27:42.000 --> 27:44.270
like your mother.

28:05.830 --> 28:07.200
Since you're sick,

28:07.200 --> 28:08.110
I won't hold your coming here

28:08.110 --> 28:09.440
against you.

28:09.830 --> 28:12.350
But how dare you mention my mother?

28:15.240 --> 28:18.480
Do you know

28:18.830 --> 28:21.160
how this unfinished chess game came to be?

28:21.680 --> 28:23.200
This was the last game

28:24.830 --> 28:26.480
your mother and I played.

28:27.790 --> 28:28.640
In this game,

28:29.310 --> 28:31.650
she clearly could have let me off,

28:31.880 --> 28:33.760
but she left me no escape.

28:34.440 --> 28:36.240
She was always like this—

28:36.720 --> 28:39.530
fiercely competitive,
refusing to let me win.

28:39.680 --> 28:41.240
Don't you dare mention her.

28:41.270 --> 28:43.750
I often racked my brains wondering

28:43.790 --> 28:45.590
how to turn the tables

28:45.590 --> 28:47.370
and defeat her.

28:47.750 --> 28:49.080
She wanted to win—

28:49.350 --> 28:50.750
as if I didn't.

28:52.000 --> 28:54.270
Haven't you always wanted to know

28:55.000 --> 28:56.830
how your mother

28:57.030 --> 28:59.240
really died?

29:00.510 --> 29:04.240
-You're finally willing to tell me.
-That's because after all these years

29:04.240 --> 29:05.790
of painstaking planning,

29:07.030 --> 29:08.680
I'm finally about to win.

29:11.240 --> 29:12.920
Many people have speculated

29:14.310 --> 29:15.680
about the real cause

29:15.680 --> 29:17.010
of your mother's death.

29:17.720 --> 29:18.550
Some think

29:19.310 --> 29:20.750
it was because she controlled
the Storm Alliance

29:20.750 --> 29:22.280
and refused to submit to me.

29:22.510 --> 29:23.590
Others think

29:24.000 --> 29:26.070
it was because she was a Jinxiu spy,

29:26.070 --> 29:27.600
and I was suspicious of her.

29:30.680 --> 29:32.960
A mere Storm Alliance—

29:33.200 --> 29:35.160
why would I fear it?

29:35.790 --> 29:36.880
I don't even

29:36.880 --> 29:38.210
take Jinxiu seriously,

29:38.640 --> 29:40.000
so why would I care about

29:40.000 --> 29:42.350
claims she was their spy?

29:43.110 --> 29:44.750
I remember everything

29:44.750 --> 29:45.880
that happened

29:45.880 --> 29:47.280
on the day my mother died.

29:47.350 --> 29:49.110
If you dare speak even half a lie,

29:49.110 --> 29:50.440
I will never let you off.

29:50.510 --> 29:51.960
In your mother's heart,

29:52.440 --> 29:55.550
there were always things
more important than me.

29:56.110 --> 29:59.400
Though she accompanied me
in conquering the world,

30:00.750 --> 30:02.680
she never treated me

30:03.830 --> 30:05.400
as emperor.

30:06.190 --> 30:10.340
[16 years ago]

30:06.400 --> 30:07.830
She never saw me

30:07.830 --> 30:10.270
as her entire world.

30:10.680 --> 30:12.480
She never belonged to me,

30:13.160 --> 30:15.200
never let me truly possess her,

30:15.830 --> 30:18.270
and never submitted to me docilely.

30:18.310 --> 30:20.000
Mom, I caught crabs!

30:20.830 --> 30:21.960
As the First Prince,

30:22.550 --> 30:24.410
Suige should be the Crown Prince.

30:25.830 --> 30:26.830
You promised that

30:27.270 --> 30:28.240
when he grew up,

30:28.240 --> 30:30.400
inheriting the throne
would be entirely his decision.

30:30.400 --> 30:31.800
You can't interfere now.

30:33.790 --> 30:35.720
So, catching crabs in the countryside

30:35.720 --> 30:37.320
isn't interfering with him,

30:38.110 --> 30:39.240
but me naming him

30:39.510 --> 30:40.440
Crown Prince is?

30:41.270 --> 30:41.870
"Naming"?

30:42.590 --> 30:43.590
I told you before:

30:44.070 --> 30:45.030
in this small courtyard,

30:45.030 --> 30:45.750
you're not allowed to

30:45.750 --> 30:47.280
act like an emperor with me.

30:50.030 --> 30:50.510
Mom!

30:50.720 --> 30:51.980
A crab is crawling out!

30:53.070 --> 30:53.720
Chop it!

30:55.070 --> 30:57.400
I'll chop anyone who dares act arrogantly

30:57.750 --> 30:58.440
before me.

30:59.750 --> 31:01.100
I couldn't control her.

31:01.790 --> 31:02.960
I knew that one day

31:03.000 --> 31:04.720
she'd leave me,

31:06.160 --> 31:07.310
as if I'd never owned

31:07.350 --> 31:08.480
her at all.

31:09.400 --> 31:11.480
Why should she have belonged to you?

31:12.270 --> 31:14.270
Just because she refused to submit,

31:15.310 --> 31:16.750
you let Zhuang Shen

31:16.790 --> 31:18.070
and Zhuang Jingyuan kill her?

31:18.070 --> 31:19.870
Because she tried to take you...

31:21.200 --> 31:23.240
from me!

31:23.720 --> 31:24.880
Come on, sit here.

31:25.750 --> 31:26.810
Is it comfortable?

31:28.590 --> 31:30.580
Then stay in the palace

31:31.350 --> 31:32.490
and rule from here.

31:32.550 --> 31:33.210
From now on,

31:33.350 --> 31:34.640
you'll sit in this chair,

31:34.640 --> 31:35.160
okay?

31:35.510 --> 31:36.070
No.

31:36.550 --> 31:38.070
I promised Mom that

31:38.070 --> 31:39.960
when I grow up,
I'll roam the world with her.

31:39.960 --> 31:41.350
You listen to your mother

31:41.350 --> 31:42.480
but not your father?

31:43.550 --> 31:46.310
If Father wanted to make you emperor
in the future,

31:46.310 --> 31:47.880
you wouldn't want that either?

31:47.880 --> 31:48.640
Mom said

31:48.680 --> 31:50.440
that ever since you became Emperor,

31:50.440 --> 31:51.920
you've become a different person.

31:51.920 --> 31:52.920
She said becoming emperor

31:52.920 --> 31:53.920
turns people bad.

31:56.350 --> 31:58.280
I wanted you to inherit the throne.

31:58.640 --> 32:00.200
I wanted to raise you to be
an even greater ruler,

32:00.200 --> 32:02.530
destined to leave a more glorious legacy!

32:02.880 --> 32:04.620
But she undermined my plans

32:04.920 --> 32:06.390
and crossed my final line.

32:06.440 --> 32:08.240
I would never allow it.

32:11.200 --> 32:13.480
So you killed her?

32:14.310 --> 32:16.580
Was it you who killed her?

32:16.830 --> 32:17.880
All these years,

32:18.270 --> 32:19.790
I've asked you again and again

32:19.790 --> 32:21.200
whether you wanted to be Crown Prince.

32:21.200 --> 32:22.680
You never appreciated it,

32:23.440 --> 32:24.750
insisting you wanted to be a general

32:24.750 --> 32:27.110
who protects the nation
and guards the land.

32:27.110 --> 32:27.790
That's when

32:28.350 --> 32:29.200
I knew

32:29.720 --> 32:32.250
you'd never forgotten
what your mother said.

32:32.350 --> 32:34.240
She's been dead all these years,

32:34.310 --> 32:36.590
yet her words still hold sway over you.

32:36.960 --> 32:37.790
You tell me,

32:38.830 --> 32:40.240
did she deserve to die?

32:41.030 --> 32:41.750
Enough!

32:52.400 --> 32:53.830
She had no great ambitions

32:53.830 --> 32:55.000
and was short-sighted,

32:55.000 --> 32:57.110
just like a common peasant woman!

32:57.200 --> 32:59.200
She wasn't worthy of being your mother,

32:59.200 --> 33:01.240
let alone worthy of being my Empress!

33:01.240 --> 33:02.400
Shut up...

33:02.480 --> 33:03.160
Suige,

33:03.960 --> 33:06.110
you cannot be like her.

33:06.440 --> 33:07.880
I gave her

33:07.880 --> 33:08.970
every honor,

33:09.110 --> 33:10.710
yet she showed no gratitude.

33:10.750 --> 33:11.640
Who did she think

33:11.640 --> 33:13.000
she was?

33:13.310 --> 33:14.750
She pretended to be so aloof.

33:14.750 --> 33:16.270
She pretended to be a hermit.

33:16.270 --> 33:18.000
She even pretended to be
so pure and untainted!

33:18.000 --> 33:19.640
Through and through, she was nothing

33:19.640 --> 33:21.790
but a peasant woman!

33:23.550 --> 33:25.070
Shut your mouth!

33:27.310 --> 33:29.110
I'll kill you!

33:32.470 --> 33:33.590
Come on!

33:34.510 --> 33:35.720
Kill me!

33:38.110 --> 33:38.720
Suige,

33:39.310 --> 33:41.860
just saying it won't do.

33:41.940 --> 33:43.400
Don't you hate me?

33:43.510 --> 33:44.380
Do it!

33:44.440 --> 33:45.800
Kill me!

33:46.030 --> 33:48.400
I simply don't think you hate me enough!

33:50.160 --> 33:51.510
Kill me!

34:09.480 --> 34:10.400
Your mother

34:11.280 --> 34:13.710
died because of you!

34:13.760 --> 34:14.440
Shut up!

34:16.550 --> 34:18.710
I'll ask you one last time:

34:19.590 --> 34:22.070
how did my mother die?

34:23.000 --> 34:24.630
Back then, before she died,

34:25.840 --> 34:27.710
she pointed a sword at me

34:27.880 --> 34:29.070
just like this.

34:29.449 --> 34:33.909
[Changchun Palace]

34:37.070 --> 34:38.190
Greetings, Your Majesty the Empress.

34:38.190 --> 34:40.320
Greetings, Your Majesty the Empress.

34:40.480 --> 34:42.719
[Changchun Palace]

34:42.190 --> 34:43.230
Your Majesty the Empress,

34:43.230 --> 34:45.020
the Jinxiu spy we caught

34:45.150 --> 34:47.670
has confessed
that you're also an accomplice.

34:47.670 --> 34:48.870
Your personal maid

34:49.110 --> 34:49.630
has also testified

34:49.630 --> 34:51.960
that you secretly met with Jinxiu people.

34:52.190 --> 34:53.530
In your bedchamber,

34:53.840 --> 34:54.730
we found

34:55.000 --> 34:58.060
secret correspondence
between you and Jinxiu people.

34:59.230 --> 35:00.160
Feng Pingcheng,

35:01.030 --> 35:02.590
just based on

35:03.150 --> 35:04.350
this petty frame-up,

35:05.280 --> 35:07.540
you want to arrest me and interrogate me?

35:08.630 --> 35:10.550
As long as you remain in the palace,

35:10.550 --> 35:11.250
trust me—

35:11.890 --> 35:14.020
I'll find out the truth for you

35:14.550 --> 35:15.680
and clear your name.

35:18.280 --> 35:19.280
Stay for how long?

35:20.070 --> 35:21.220
You just want to

35:21.480 --> 35:22.860
trap me in the palace.

35:23.430 --> 35:24.710
Why the excuse?

35:25.110 --> 35:26.440
We are husband and wife.

35:27.000 --> 35:28.590
I can choose not to pursue

35:29.110 --> 35:31.310
the suspicion that you're a Jinxiu spy.

35:31.480 --> 35:32.920
If you insist on leaving,

35:34.280 --> 35:35.670
I won't have anyone

35:35.670 --> 35:36.670
stop you.

35:39.800 --> 35:40.320
But...

35:41.590 --> 35:42.710
I won't allow you

35:42.760 --> 35:44.670
to take Suige and Xiyang with you.

35:48.630 --> 35:49.760
They are my children.

35:49.760 --> 35:51.170
Why can't I take them?

35:51.280 --> 35:53.140
I'm not discussing this with you.

35:53.960 --> 35:54.890
Feng Pingcheng,

35:55.320 --> 35:56.740
look in the mirror

35:56.920 --> 35:57.550
and see

35:57.550 --> 35:58.920
what you've become!

35:59.360 --> 36:01.760
You've been blinded by your lust
for power.

36:01.960 --> 36:03.160
This imperial palace

36:03.630 --> 36:05.110
has become your cage.

36:06.230 --> 36:07.000
I will never

36:07.000 --> 36:07.920
let my children

36:08.920 --> 36:10.070
follow your path.

36:13.800 --> 36:14.580
Listen up,

36:16.280 --> 36:17.770
from now on,

36:17.920 --> 36:18.880
those two children

36:18.880 --> 36:20.730
have nothing to do with you whatsoever.

36:20.730 --> 36:23.590
Try taking them and see what happens.

36:41.840 --> 36:42.550
Sister, it's in your nature

36:42.550 --> 36:44.380
to resist staying in the palace for long.

36:44.380 --> 36:45.480
Because of that, His Majesty

36:45.480 --> 36:47.160
has lost his temper many times
over the years.

36:47.160 --> 36:48.960
Now that things have come to this point,

36:48.960 --> 36:49.670
Sister, please don't

36:49.670 --> 36:51.150
provoke His Majesty further.

36:51.150 --> 36:53.290
The children are better off raised here

36:53.290 --> 36:54.420
in the palace

36:54.480 --> 36:56.400
than suffering hardships outside.

36:56.400 --> 36:57.280
In the future, I'll take care of

36:57.280 --> 36:58.510
those two children for you.

36:58.510 --> 36:59.630
Please rest assured.

36:59.630 --> 37:00.960
Who do you think you are?

37:01.150 --> 37:02.380
I'm talking to Feng Pingcheng.

37:02.380 --> 37:03.840
You have no place to speak!

37:04.510 --> 37:05.970
Your Majesty the Empress,

37:06.280 --> 37:07.400
you bear the title

37:07.920 --> 37:10.000
yet refuse to share His Majesty's burdens—

37:10.000 --> 37:11.590
you disgrace the position.

37:14.400 --> 37:15.230
I've long

37:15.710 --> 37:17.640
since tired of being this Empress.

37:18.550 --> 37:19.400
Wei Qingyu.

37:23.070 --> 37:25.110
Do you know what you're saying?

37:26.070 --> 37:27.600
Listen up, Feng Pingcheng,

37:28.070 --> 37:29.600
I will never let Suige

37:30.190 --> 37:31.400
follow your path,

37:31.630 --> 37:33.400
trapped by power as you are.

37:34.030 --> 37:35.030
His path forward

37:36.590 --> 37:38.880
will be his own choice.

37:48.630 --> 37:49.560
Stop, all of you!

37:53.550 --> 37:55.320
Suige must stay.

37:56.440 --> 37:57.150
This is

37:57.880 --> 37:59.400
not up to you.

38:02.880 --> 38:04.080
Protect His Majesty!

38:08.400 --> 38:09.600
I warned you long ago—

38:10.190 --> 38:11.630
I'll cut down anyone who dares to

38:11.630 --> 38:13.090
act arrogantly before me!

38:14.670 --> 38:15.870
You are no exception.

38:16.360 --> 38:17.160
Your Majesty!

39:18.110 --> 39:19.840
Since the moment she died,

39:20.760 --> 39:22.320
these past 15 years,

39:22.360 --> 39:24.220
I've devoted myself to one thing—

39:24.800 --> 39:28.190
molding you, through relentless effort,

39:28.280 --> 39:30.230
into exactly the person

39:30.280 --> 39:32.400
I envisioned.

39:40.880 --> 39:42.110
When you were a child,

39:42.190 --> 39:44.280
you were just like your mother—

39:44.880 --> 39:46.630
the kindness and compassion in your bones

39:46.630 --> 39:48.140
made me sick.

39:48.320 --> 39:50.070
You are my son.

39:50.510 --> 39:52.320
You're in the royal family.

39:52.400 --> 39:54.880
You are the heir I've chosen!

39:54.960 --> 39:56.550
You must be even more cold-blooded

39:56.550 --> 39:58.280
and ruthless than I am!

40:01.000 --> 40:02.830
Xiyang and I had only one mother.

40:02.960 --> 40:04.490
I don't want her to raise us.

40:05.550 --> 40:06.920
From now on,

40:08.110 --> 40:08.590
she...

40:10.920 --> 40:13.190
is your mother.

40:15.960 --> 40:18.150
So you did all of that on purpose.

40:20.630 --> 40:22.440
On the day my mother died,

40:22.440 --> 40:23.960
the first thing you said to me

40:23.960 --> 40:24.710
was to make me

40:24.710 --> 40:26.570
accept someone else as my mother.

40:26.880 --> 40:28.280
From that moment on,

40:29.550 --> 40:31.960
you meant to make me hate you.

40:32.880 --> 40:34.960
Without soul-deep hatred,

40:35.840 --> 40:36.960
how else could I have

40:36.960 --> 40:38.890
rid you of the weakness inside you?

40:39.190 --> 40:40.150
All these years,

40:40.400 --> 40:41.230
you've clawed your way forward

40:41.230 --> 40:42.560
on your own.

40:43.150 --> 40:45.480
My painstaking efforts were not in vain.

40:47.000 --> 40:48.070
You've gone mad.

40:48.070 --> 40:50.000
Only through madness can one win.

40:51.360 --> 40:53.520
You only care about victory

40:53.800 --> 40:54.960
and yourself!

40:55.960 --> 40:58.110
My mother died because of you!

40:58.110 --> 41:00.440
-You never deserved her!
-I deserved her!

41:02.480 --> 41:04.110
I gave her

41:04.110 --> 41:06.770
all the beautiful things,
but she refused them.

41:06.920 --> 41:08.880
What she rejected, I give to you.

41:09.110 --> 41:10.100
Am I wrong?

41:10.280 --> 41:12.360
I want to hand you the realm I conquered

41:12.360 --> 41:14.000
with my own blood! Am I wrong?

41:14.000 --> 41:14.790
Am I...

41:15.670 --> 41:17.280
Go on, keep shouting and cursing!

41:17.280 --> 41:18.480
Why have you stopped?

41:20.590 --> 41:21.850
I'm holding the sword.

41:22.150 --> 41:23.070
You know your son

41:23.070 --> 41:23.670
won't kill you.

41:23.670 --> 41:24.360
But I will!

41:24.920 --> 41:26.380
I won't show you any mercy!

41:27.150 --> 41:28.760
When my son and I are talking,

41:29.510 --> 41:31.800
it's not your place to interrupt.

41:32.150 --> 41:32.800
Your son?

41:33.670 --> 41:35.230
In what way do you resemble a father?

41:35.230 --> 41:36.280
Although I have no parents

41:36.280 --> 41:36.880
or kin,

41:37.360 --> 41:38.000
I know

41:38.000 --> 41:38.960
real families

41:38.960 --> 41:40.120
are not like this.

41:40.320 --> 41:41.630
I've never seen a father

41:41.630 --> 41:43.170
hurt his son like this

41:43.230 --> 41:44.690
or force his son like this!

41:45.070 --> 41:46.150
The "son" you speak of

41:46.150 --> 41:46.840
is nothing but a tool

41:46.840 --> 41:48.000
to carry on your ambition!

41:48.000 --> 41:49.530
What kind of father are you?

41:52.150 --> 41:53.880
This is the investiture edict.

41:54.550 --> 41:56.620
I've already named you Crown Prince.

41:56.800 --> 41:58.480
All these years,
I've kept Zhuang Shen alive

41:58.480 --> 41:59.510
only to use him

41:59.510 --> 42:00.840
as a means to hone you!

42:00.880 --> 42:02.840
I'm handing you the thing
I've treasured most

42:02.840 --> 42:03.560
in my life!

42:04.000 --> 42:04.440
Go!

42:04.630 --> 42:05.760
Storm the palace,

42:05.800 --> 42:06.880
seize the imperial seal,

42:06.880 --> 42:08.080
and stamp this edict.

42:08.230 --> 42:09.550
Then you will be the Crown Prince.

42:09.550 --> 42:11.440
Kill me! After I die,

42:11.440 --> 42:13.170
you'll be the emperor of Susha!

42:13.280 --> 42:15.110
I'm entrusting the nation to you!

42:15.110 --> 42:18.000
You must make this country even stronger!

42:18.100 --> 42:19.840
That's just your wishful thinking!

42:19.840 --> 42:22.030
That's not what Feng Suige truly wants!

42:22.030 --> 42:24.490
You need say no more!

42:24.670 --> 42:26.070
You don't love him at all.

42:26.360 --> 42:27.590
You just have no other choice.

42:27.590 --> 42:29.190
Have you ever protected him?

42:29.230 --> 42:30.000
Where were you

42:30.000 --> 42:31.030
when he needed you?

42:31.030 --> 42:31.920
You keep saying

42:31.920 --> 42:32.980
you are his father,

42:33.030 --> 42:34.150
but have you ever done

42:34.150 --> 42:35.750
one thing a father should do?

42:37.550 --> 42:38.440
Look at

42:38.440 --> 42:39.770
what you've become now.

42:40.150 --> 42:42.590
Abandoned by all, family shattered,
wife dead, and children estranged.

42:42.590 --> 42:43.320
You treat your son

42:43.320 --> 42:44.240
like an enemy,

42:44.510 --> 42:45.280
yet still pretend to be

42:45.280 --> 42:45.960
a loving father.

42:45.960 --> 42:47.070
Aren't you ashamed of such hypocrisy?

42:47.070 --> 42:47.670
And now

42:47.670 --> 42:48.440
you're taking refuge here.

42:48.440 --> 42:49.670
This was his mother's place.

42:49.670 --> 42:50.630
Do you even deserve to be here?

42:50.630 --> 42:52.400
I am a wise ruler.

42:52.880 --> 42:55.000
You don't understand
my painstaking efforts

42:55.000 --> 42:57.230
or my duty to family and country!

42:57.320 --> 42:58.380
Do you understand?

42:59.070 --> 43:00.210
As it's said,

43:00.400 --> 43:01.880
family comes before country!

43:01.880 --> 43:03.150
You don't even care for your own family—

43:03.150 --> 43:04.710
how can you speak of duty
to family and country!
